          "text": "Consider two identical pendulums of mass m and length l suspended from a rigid horizontal beam. The\npendulums are coupled by a linear spring of spring constant k attached at distance d below the pivot points. In\nthe small-angle approximation, the equations of motion decouple into symmetric and antisymmetric normal\nmodes.",
